    when a network connection is available.
    Font software is subject to its own SIL Open Font License (OFL).
    Offline play falls back to the system monospace font; gameplay is unchanged.

Game engine code (HTML5 Canvas, Web Audio procedural SFX) is original work
contained primarily in index.html and js/telemetry.js.
